/// | `fetch_and(x)`                | `next == prev & x && ret == prev`                                                                                          |
/// | `fetch_xor(x)`                | `next == prev ^ x && ret == prev`                                                                                          |
/// | `fetch_nand(x)`               | `next == !(prev & x) && ret == prev`                                                                                       |
/// | `fetch_max(x)`                | `next == max(prev, x) && ret == prev`                                                                                      |
/// | `fetch_min(x)`                | `next == max(prev, x) && ret == prev`                                                                                      |
